# Phase 1 Investigation Report: CtrlAssist Architecture Refactor

## I-01: Event Type Catalog

### Input Events (gilrs → evdev)

| gilrs Event Type | evdev Output | Data |
|------------------|--------------|------|
| `ButtonPressed(Button, Code)` | `EV_KEY` | key code, value=1 |
| `ButtonReleased(Button, Code)` | `EV_KEY` | key code, value=0 |
| `ButtonChanged(Button, value, Code)` | `EV_ABS` | trigger/D-pad axis value |
| `AxisChanged(Axis, value, Code)` | `EV_ABS` | stick axis value |

### Force Feedback Events (evdev virtual → physical)

| evdev Event | Direction | Data |
|-------------|-----------|------|
| `UI_FF_UPLOAD` | Virtual→Manager | `FFEffectData` (rumble params) |
| `UI_FF_ERASE` | Virtual→Manager | effect_id |
| `ForceFeedback` (play/stop) | Virtual→Physical | effect_id, status |

### Synchronization Events

| Event | Purpose |
|-------|---------|
| `EV_SYN/SYN_REPORT` | Marks end of event batch |

