## I-02: Event Lifecycle Traces

### Input Event Flow

```
┌─────────────┐     ┌──────────┐     ┌────────────┐     ┌───────────┐
│ Physical    │     │ gilrs    │     │ MuxMode/   │     │ evdev     │
│ Controllers │────▶│ Poll     │────▶│ DemuxMode  │────▶│ VirtualDev│
└─────────────┘     └──────────┘     └────────────┘     └───────────┘
                         │                 │
                         │ Event           │ MuxOutput/
                         │ {id, event,     │ DemuxOutput
                         │  time}          │ {events, active}
                         ▼                 ▼
                    next_event_        InputEvent::new()
                    blocking()         send_events()
```

**Steps**:
1. `gilrs.next_event_blocking()` returns `gilrs::Event`
2. Filter by Primary/Assist IDs
3. `mode.handle_event()` processes, returns [MuxOutput](file:///home/ruffsl/git/ruffsl/CtrlAssist/src/mux/modes/mod.rs#20-26)
4. Convert gilrs types → `evdev::InputEvent`
5. `device.send_events()` to virtual device

### Force Feedback Flow

```
┌───────────┐     ┌─────────────┐     ┌─────────────┐     ┌──────────────┐
│ Game      │     │ Virtual     │     │ FF Thread   │     │ Physical     │
│ (writes)  │────▶│ Device      │────▶│ (routes)    │────▶│ Controllers  │
└───────────┘     └─────────────┘     └─────────────┘     └──────────────┘
                        │                    │
                        │ fetch_events()     │ EffectManager
                        │ EventSummary       │ PhysicalFFDev
                        ▼                    ▼
                   upload/erase/        upload_ff_effect()
                   play/stop            play()/stop()
```

**Steps**:
1. Game writes to virtual device (evdev file)
2. `v_uinput.fetch_events()` returns `EventSummary`
3. `EffectManager.upload()`/[erase()](file:///home/ruffsl/git/ruffsl/CtrlAssist/src/utils/ff.rs#127-132)/[set_playing()](file:///home/ruffsl/git/ruffsl/CtrlAssist/src/utils/ff.rs#133-137) tracks state
4. [PhysicalFFDev](file:///home/ruffsl/git/ruffsl/CtrlAssist/src/utils/ff.rs#6-11) forwards to physical controllers based on `RumbleTarget`

