## Prototype Recommendations

### P-01: CtrlEvent Enum

```rust
pub enum CtrlEvent {
    // Input events (forward direction)
    Input(InputEvent),
    
    // Feedback events (reverse direction)
    ForceFeedback(FFEvent),
    LED(LEDEvent),
    
    // Future extensions
    Motion(MotionEvent),
    Touchpad(TouchpadEvent),
    
    // Raw for exotic devices
    Raw { device_id: DeviceId, data: Vec<u8> },
}

pub struct InputEvent {
    pub source: DeviceId,
    pub input: InputKind,
    pub value: f32, // Normalized -1.0 to 1.0 or 0.0 to 1.0
}

pub enum InputKind {
    Button(ButtonId),
    Axis(AxisId),
    Trigger(TriggerId),
}
```

### P-02: Node Trait Hierarchy

```rust
pub trait Node: Send + Sync {
    fn name(&self) -> &str;
    fn ports(&self) -> NodePorts;
    fn process(&mut self, port: PortId, event: CtrlEvent) -> Vec<(PortId, CtrlEvent)>;
}

pub struct NodePorts {
    pub inputs: Vec<PortDef>,
    pub outputs: Vec<PortDef>,
}
```

### P-03: Graph Executor

```rust
pub struct Graph {
    nodes: SlotMap<NodeId, Box<dyn Node>>,
    edges: Vec<Edge>,
}

pub struct Edge {
    from_node: NodeId,
    from_port: PortId,
    to_node: NodeId,
    to_port: PortId,
}

impl Graph {
    pub fn inject(&mut self, node: NodeId, port: PortId, event: CtrlEvent);
    pub fn tick(&mut self) -> Vec<(NodeId, PortId, CtrlEvent)>; // Outputs
}
```

